# Build > Bulk Crystal: crystal system, space group (both origins where
# there are two), lattice parameters and the asymmetric unit; the crystal
# replaces the open structure as one undo step.
bulk open
bulk set system cubic
bulk set spacegroup 225
bulk set a 5.64
bulk set sites Na 0 0 0; Cl 0.5 0.5 0.5
bulk build
expect-tabs 1
expect-atoms 8
structure-info
expect-info Space group = Fm-3m (No. 225)
bulk set spacegroup 227
bulk set a 5.431
bulk set sites Si 0 0 0
bulk build
expect-atoms 8
structure-info
expect-info Space group = Fd-3m (No. 227)
bulk set origin 2
bulk set sites Si 0.125 0.125 0.125
bulk build
expect-atoms 8
structure-info
expect-info Space group = Fd-3m (No. 227)
bulk set system hexagonal
bulk set spacegroup 194
bulk set a 3.21
bulk set c 5.21
bulk set sites Mg 0.333333 0.666667 0.25
bulk build
expect-atoms 2
structure-info
expect-info Cell angles = γ = 120.00°
undo
expect-atoms 8
command bulk crystal
reset-view
screenshot rust/target/ui/builders.png
quit
